{"availability":"available","full":"jinqians/psm-panel","name":"psm-panel","description":"一个基于cloudflare的多机科学上网管理脚本，支持xray、singbox、mihomo内核，支持一键搭建VLESS REALITY / Vision / XHTTP、Hysteria2、TUIC v5、AnyTLS、Snell、Shadowsocks 2022、Trojan、VMess、SOCKS5、WireGuard，支持订阅导出，支持warp和免费家宽（VPNGATE项目）分流以及指定分流","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":19,"forks":17,"created":"2026-09-14T11:55:13Z","updated":"2026-10-07T08:15:43Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://psm-panel-docs.pages.dev/","topics":[],"demo":"https://psm-panel-docs.pages.dev/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:06.319Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:06.319Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:06.319Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T14:47:06.319Z","stars":19,"forks":17}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["PSM 的网页管理面板：在一个网页里管理多台 VPS 的节点、安装、状态和流量，并把所有节点汇总成一个订阅。"],"features":["一键部署到 Cloudflare：后端和页面运行在 Cloudflare Workers 上，数据存 D1，免费额度就够用；只需要填一个管理员密码。","VPS 不开放任何端口：每台 VPS 上的 psm-agent 主动用 HTTPS 连面板，领取任务、回报结果；不需要子域名、Tunnel 或防火墙规则。","没装过 PSM 也能接入：面板给出的一条命令会先装好 PSM，再接入面板；节点用到哪个内核（Xray / sing-box / mihomo）就自动装哪个。","节点：PSM 支持的全部协议，Snell 和 SS2022 可以用独立的 snell-server（v4 / v5 / v6）和 ss-rust 运行；新建、修改、删除都在面板里完成。","流量：每个节点本月用量、每日图表、流量上限（超额自动暂停，到重置日或手动重置后恢复）。"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jinqians/psm-panel/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9557b4fe75b09167bb1cc7ad9f80123feb6af6056d149287d318b71981941460","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:06.454Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:06.454Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"PSM 的网页管理面板：在一个网页里管理多台 VPS 的节点、安装、状态和流量，并把所有节点汇总成一个订阅。","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jinqians/psm-panel/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"9557b4fe75b09167bb1cc7ad9f80123feb6af6056d149287d318b71981941460","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jinqians/psm-panel/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:06.454Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-0